---
---
<section class="fade-up">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-label">Certified</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Trained within a documented lineage</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">Both levels of Usui Reiki Ryoho, with the teaching lineage traced back to Mikao Usui, Chujiro Hayashi and Hawayo Takata.</p>
    <div class="cert-grid">
      <div class="cert">
        <img src="/images/reiki/diploma-level-1.webp" alt="Diploma — Usui Reiki Ryoho, Level I" loading="lazy" width="600" height="848" style="border-radius:12px;width:100%;cursor:zoom-in;" onclick="document.getElementById('lightbox').style.display='flex';document.getElementById('lb-img').src=this.src;document.getElementById('lb-img').alt=this.alt;" />
        <div class="cert-title">Usui Reiki Ryoho — Level I</div>
        <div class="cert-meta">School of Reiki Master Olena Yushko, Ukraine · December 2025</div>
      </div>
      <div class="cert">
        <img src="/images/reiki/diploma-level-2.webp" alt="Diploma — Usui Reiki Ryoho, Level II" loading="lazy" width="600" height="848" style="border-radius:12px;width:100%;cursor:zoom-in;" onclick="document.getElementById('lightbox').style.display='flex';document.getElementById('lb-img').src=this.src;document.getElementById('lb-img').alt=this.alt;" />
        <div class="cert-title">Usui Reiki Ryoho — Level II</div>
        <div class="cert-meta">School of Reiki Master Olena Yushko, Ukraine · February 2026</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="cert-note">Signed by Olena Yushko, Reiki Master-Teacher. Diplomas are issued in Ukrainian; Level II includes the second-degree symbols and distance practice.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Lightbox overlay -->
<div id="lightbox" onclick="this.style.display='none'" style="display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:9999;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.92);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);cursor:zoom-out;justify-content:center;align-items:center;padding:24px;">
  <button onclick="event.stopPropagation();this.parentElement.style.display='none'" style="position:absolute;top:20px;right:24px;background:none;border:none;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);font-size:32px;cursor:pointer;z-index:10;transition:color .2s;" onmouseover="this.style.color='#fff'" onmouseout="this.style.color='rgba(255,255,255,0.6)'">&times;</button>
  <img id="lb-img" src="" alt="" style="max-width:90vw;max-height:90vh;object-fit:contain;border-radius:4px;" onclick="event.stopPropagation()" />
</div>
